  "owner": "ace",
  "summary": "Works with Brazilian schools and public institutions to replace some meat meals with plant-based ones. A re-implementation of Animal Charity Evaluators' cost-effectiveness sheet (1 program with SADs averted estimates: Institutional Meat reduction CE).",
  "source": {
    "publisher": "Animal Charity Evaluators",
    "title": "Sociedade Vegetariana Brasileira review",
    "url": "https://animalcharityevaluators.org/charity-review/sociedade-vegetariana-brasileira-svb/",
    "sheet": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1wIFA3Fo9bgXn9Fc7nTT7ia_WpRNQBcneDrH-bXUhPyk/edit",
